  "id": "alexia",
  "term": "alexia",
  "definition": "Alexia is a loss or weakening of the ability to read, especially to grasp the meaning of written or printed words seen with the eyes. In historical psychology and medicine, it was grouped with speech-related disorders and was also called word-blindness or text-blindness.",
